@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml
title L0：消息组件完整生命周期总览

actor "业务发布方" as ProducerApp
participant "MessageTemplate" as Template
participant "EnvelopeEnricher" as Enricher
participant "DestinationResolver" as Resolver
participant "MessageWireCodec" as Codec
participant "MessageProvider\nKafka / RocketMQ / Pulsar" as Provider
queue "Broker" as Broker
participant "Provider Consumer" as Consumer
participant "MessageContextAccessor" as Context
participant "MessageHandler" as Handler

ProducerApp -> Template: send(destination, envelope)
Template -> Enricher: 补齐 metadata/context
Enricher --> Template: enriched envelope
Template -> Resolver: 逻辑目的地解析
Resolver --> Template: provider + physical destination
Template -> Codec: encode(envelope)
Codec --> Template: ProviderSendRequest
Template -> Provider: send(request)
Provider -> Broker: 原生消息发送
Broker --> Provider: 确认 / 拒绝 / 结果不确定
Provider --> Template: ProviderSendResult
Template --> ProducerApp: SendResult

== 异步消费 ==
Broker -> Consumer: 投递原生消息
Consumer -> Template: ProviderInboundMessage
Template -> Codec: decode(inbound)
Codec --> Template: MessageEnvelope + ConsumeContext
Template -> Context: open(current message)
Template -> Handler: handle(envelope, context)
Handler --> Template: SUCCESS / RETRY
Template -> Context: close()
Template --> Consumer: ConsumeDecision
Consumer --> Broker: commit / ack / retry

note over Template,Handler
一期只统一普通消息闭环。
重试次数、DLQ、幂等、Outbox 在二期治理。
顺序、延时、事务、回放在三期扩展。
end note
@enduml
